      "title": "Isolation in the database",
      "items": [
        "Every tenant table: row-level security enabled and forced",
        "No workspace set, no row visible or writable",
        "Login users are NOINHERIT; each transaction sets its role",
        "The console role has no access to company tables"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Shared rules",
      "items": [
